msgid "The MRCI program"
msgstr "MRCI 程序"

msgid ""
"Multiconfiguration reference internally contracted configuration interaction"
msgstr "多参考态内收缩组态相互作用"

msgid "Bibliography:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid "For excited state calculations:"
msgstr "对于激发态计算："

msgid "Knowles and H.-J. Werner, Theor. Chim. Acta **84**, 95 (1992)."
msgstr "Knowles and H.-J. Werner, Theor. Chim. Acta **84**, 95 (1992)."

msgid "For explicitly correlated MRCI (MRCI-F12):"
msgstr "对于显式相关 MRCI (MRCI-F12)："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of the corresponding methods must "
"acknowledge the above."
msgstr "所有使用相应方法发表的出版物必须引用上述文献。"

msgid "The first internally correlated MRCI program was described in:"
msgstr "首个内部相关MRCI程序描述于："

msgid "The following options may be specified on the command line:"
msgstr "以下选项可以在命令行中指定："

msgid "``NOCHECK`` Do not stop if no convergence."
msgstr "``NOCHECK`` 如果不收敛，不停止。"

msgid "``DIRECT`` Do calculation integral direct."
msgstr "``DIRECT`` 以直接积分方式进行计算。"

msgid "``NOSING`` Do not include singly external configurations."
msgstr "``NOSING`` 不包含单外部组态。"

msgid ""
"``NOPAIR`` Do not include doubly external configurations (not valid for "
"single reference methods)."
msgstr "``NOPAIR`` 不包含双外禀组态（对单参考方法无效）。"

msgid ""
"``SWAP|NOSWAP`` If ``SWAP`` is given, the MRCI wavefunctions are reordered "
"according to maximum overlap with the reference functions (this only applies"
" in multi-state calculations). The default is ``NOSWAP``, i.e. the states "
"are ordered according to increasing MRCI energy."
msgstr ""
"``SWAP|NOSWAP`` 如果指定了 ``SWAP``\\ ，MRCI 波函数将根据与参考函数的最大重叠重新排序（这仅适用于多态计算）。默认值为 "
"``NOSWAP``\\ ，即态按 MRCI 能量递增的顺序排列。"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"The internally contracted MRCI program is called by the CI command. This "
"includes as special cases single reference CI, CEPA, ACPF, MR-ACPF and MR-"
"AQCC. For closed-shell reference functions, a special faster code exists, "
"which can be called using the CISD, QCI, or CCSD commands. This also allows "
"to calculate Brueckner orbitals for all three cases (QCI and CCSD are "
"identical in this case)."
msgstr ""
"内收缩 MRCI 程序通过 CI 命令调用。这包括作为特例的单参考 CI、CEPA、ACPF、MR-ACPF 和 MR-"
"AQCC。对于闭壳层参考函数，存在一个更快的特殊代码，可以通过 CISD、QCI 或 CCSD 命令调用。这也允许为所有三种情况计算 Brueckner"
" 轨道（QCI 和 CCSD 在此情况下相同）。"

msgid ""
"The explicitly correlated variant is called by the command ``MRCI-F12``, see"
" section `explicitly correlated MRCI-F12 <the_mrci_program.html#explicitly-"
"correlated-mrci-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"显式相关变体通过命令 ``MRCI-F12`` 调用，参见 `显式相关 MRCI-F12 "
"<the_mrci_program.html#explicitly-correlated-mrci-f12>`__ 节。"

msgid ""
"With no further input cards, the wavefunction definition (core, closed, and "
"active orbital spaces, symmetry) corresponds to the one used in the most "
"recently done SCF or MCSCF calculation. By default, a CASSCF reference space"
" is generated. Other choices can be made using the ``OCC``, ``CORE``, "
"``CLOSED``, ``WF``, ``SELECT``, ``CON``, and ``RESTRICT`` cards. The "
"orbitals are taken from the corresponding SCF or MCSCF calculation unless an"
" ``ORBITAL`` directive is given. The wavefunction may be saved using the "
"``SAVE`` directive, and restarted using ``START``. The ``EXPEC`` directive "
"allows to compute expectation values over one-electron operators, and the "
"``TRAN`` directive can be used to compute transition matrix elements for "
"one-electron properties. Natural orbitals can be printed and saved using the"
" ``NATORB`` directive."
msgstr ""
"在没有进一步输入卡的情况下，波函数定义（芯层、闭壳层和活性轨道空间，对称性）对应于最近一次完成的 SCF 或 MCSCF "
"计算中使用的定义。默认情况下，会生成一个 CASSCF 参考空间。可以使用 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ "
"``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ ``WF``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT``\\ 、\\ ``CON`` 和 ``RESTRICT`` "
"卡进行其他选择。除非给出了 ``ORBITAL`` 指令，否则轨道取自相应的 SCF 或 MCSCF 计算。波函数可以使用 ``SAVE`` "
"指令保存，并使用 ``START`` 重新启动。\\ ``EXPEC`` 指令允许计算单电子算符的期望值，\\ ``TRAN`` "
"指令可用于计算单电子性质的跃迁矩阵元。可以使用 ``NATORB`` 指令打印和保存自然轨道。"

msgid ""
"For excited state calculations see ``STATE``, ``REFSTATE``, and ``PROJECT``."
msgstr "对于激发态计算，请参见 ``STATE``\\ 、\\ ``REFSTATE`` 和 ``PROJECT``\\ 。"

msgid "Specifying the wavefunction"
msgstr "指定波函数"

msgid ""
"Note: All occupations must be given before ``WF``, ``PAIRSS``, ``DOMAIN``, "
"``REGION`` or other directives that need the occupations."
msgstr ""
"注意：所有占据数必须在需要占据数的 ``WF``\\ 、\\ ``PAIRSS``\\ 、\\ ``DOMAIN``\\ 、\\ ``REGION`` "
"或其他指令之前给出。"

msgid "Occupied orbitals"
msgstr "占据轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` specifies numbers of occupied orbitals (including ``CORE`` and "
"``CLOSED``) in irreducible representation number :math:`i`. If not given, "
"the information defaults to that from the most recent SCF, MCSCF or CI "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 指定了不可约表示编号 :math:`i` 中的占据轨道数（包括 ``CORE`` 和 ``CLOSED``\\ "
"）。如果未给出，则信息默认为来自最近的 SCF、MCSCF 或 CI 计算。"

msgid "Frozen-core orbitals"
msgstr "冻结芯轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` is the number of frozen-core orbitals in irrep number :math:`i`."
" These orbitals are doubly occupied in all configurations, i.e., not "
"correlated. If no ``CORE`` card is given, the program uses the same core "
"orbitals as the last CI calculation; if there was none, then the atomic "
"inner shells are taken as core. To avoid this behaviour and correlate all "
"electrons, specify"
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 是第 :math:`i` 个不可约表示中的冻结芯轨道数。这些轨道在所有组态中都是双占据的，即不参与相关。如果未给出 "
"``CORE`` 卡片，程序将使用与上一次 CI 计算相同的芯轨道；如果没有先前的 CI "
"计算，则将原子内壳层视为芯轨道。为避免此行为并使所有电子参与相关，请指定"

msgid "``CORE``"
msgstr "``CORE``"

msgid "Closed-shell orbitals"
msgstr "闭壳层轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` is the number of closed-shell orbitals in irrep number "
":math:`i`, inclusive of any core orbitals. These orbitals do not form part "
"of the active space, i.e., they are doubly occupied in all reference CSFs; "
"however, in contrast to the core orbitals (see ``CORE``), these orbitals are"
" correlated through single and double excitations. If not given, the "
"information defaults to that from the most recent SCF, MCSCF or CI "
"calculation. For calculations with closed-shell reference function "
"(closed=occ), see ``CISD``, ``QCI``, and ``CCSD``."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 是第 :math:`i` "
"个不可约表示中闭壳层轨道的数量，包括任何芯轨道。这些轨道不构成活性空间的一部分，即在所有参考组态态函数中它们都是双占据的；然而，与芯轨道（参见 "
"``CORE``\\ ）不同，这些轨道通过单双激发进行关联。如果未指定，信息将默认取自最近的 SCF、MCSCF 或 CI "
"计算。对于具有闭壳层参考函数（closed=occ）的计算，请参见 ``CISD``\\ 、\\ ``QCI`` 和 ``CCSD``\\ 。"

msgid "Defining the orbitals"
msgstr "定义轨道"

msgid ""
"*name.file* specifies the record from which orbitals are read. Optionally, "
"various *specifications* can be given to select specific orbitals if "
"*name.file* contains more than one orbital set. For details see section "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__. Note that the ``IGNORE_ERROR`` option can be used to "
"force MPn or triples calculations with non-canonical orbitals."
msgstr ""
"*name.file* 指定从中读取轨道的记录。可选地，如果 *name.file* 包含多个轨道集，可以给出各种 *specifications* "
"来选择特定的轨道。详细信息请参见章节 `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__\\ 。注意，\\ ``IGNORE_ERROR`` 选项可用于强制使用非正则轨道进行 MPn "
"或三重激发计算。"

msgid ""
"The default is the set of orbitals from the last SCF, MCSCF or CI "
"calculation."
msgstr "默认是来自最后一次 SCF、MCSCF 或 CI 计算的轨道集。"

msgid "Defining the state symmetry"
msgstr "定义态对称性"

msgid ""
"The number of electrons and the total symmetry of the wavefunction are "
"specified on the ``WF`` card:"
msgstr "电子数和波函数的总对称性在 ``WF`` 卡片上指定："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"The WF card must be placed after any cards defining the orbital spaces "
"``OCC``, ``CORE``, ``CLOSED``."
msgstr "``WF`` 卡片必须放在任何定义轨道空间 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED`` 的卡片之后。"

msgid ""
"The ``REF`` card can be used to define further reference symmetries used for"
" generating the configuration space, see ``REF``."
msgstr "``REF`` 卡片可用于定义用于生成组态空间的额外参考对称性，参见 ``REF``\\ 。"

msgid "Additional reference symmetries"
msgstr "额外参考对称性"

msgid ""
"This card, which must come after the ``WF`` directive, defines an additional"
" reference symmetry used for generating the uncontracted internal and singly"
" external configuration spaces. This is sometimes useful in order to obtain "
"the same configuration spaces when different point group symmetries are "
"used. For instance, if a calculation is done in :math:`C_s` symmetry, it may"
" happen that the two components of a :math:`\\Pi` state, one of which "
"appears in :math:`A'` and the other in :math:`A''`, come out not exactly "
"degenerate. This problem can be avoided as in the following example:"
msgstr ""
"此卡片必须位于 ``WF`` "
"指令之后，它定义了一个额外的参考对称性，用于生成未收缩的内部和单外部组态空间。这有时很有用，以便在使用不同点群对称性时获得相同的组态空间。例如，如果在 "
":math:`C_s` 对称性下进行计算，可能会出现 :math:`\\Pi` 态的两个分量（一个出现在 :math:`A'`\\ ，另一个出现在 "
":math:`A''`\\ ）不完全简并的情况。可以按照以下示例避免此问题："

msgid "for a doublet :math:`A'` state:"
msgstr "对于一个双重态 :math:`A'` 态："

msgid "and for the doublet A” state:"
msgstr "以及对于双重态 A” 态："

msgid ""
"For linear geometries the same results can be obtained more cheaply using "
":math:`C_{2v}` symmetry,"
msgstr "对于线性几何结构，使用 :math:`C_{2v}` 对称性可以更经济地获得相同的结果，"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Each ``REF`` card may be followed by ``RESTRICT``, ``SELECT``, and ``CON`` "
"cards, in the given order."
msgstr "每个 ``REF`` 卡片之后可以按给定顺序跟随 ``RESTRICT``\\ 、\\ ``SELECT`` 和 ``CON`` 卡片。"

msgid "Selecting configurations"
msgstr "选择组态"

msgid ""
"This card is used to specify a reference configuration set other than a CAS,"
" which is the default. Configurations can be defined using ``CON`` cards, "
"which must appear after the *SELECT* card. Alternatively, if *ref1* is an "
"existing Molpro record name, the configurations are read in from that record"
" and may be selected according to a given threshold."
msgstr ""
"此卡片用于指定一个非 CAS（默认值）的参考组态集。组态可以使用 ``CON`` 卡片定义，这些卡片必须出现在 *SELECT* 卡片之后。或者，如果 "
"*ref1* 是一个现有的 Molpro 记录名称，则从该记录中读取组态，并可根据给定的阈值进行选择。"

msgid ""
"The select card must be placed directly after the *WF* or *REF* card(s), or,"
" if present, the ``RESTRICT`` cards. The general order of these cards is"
msgstr ""
"选择卡片必须直接放置在 *WF* 或 *REF* 卡片之后，或者，如果存在，则放置在 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片之后。这些卡片的一般顺序是"

msgid "Occupation restrictions"
msgstr "占据限制"

msgid ""
"This card can be used to restrict the occupation patterns in the reference "
"configurations. Only configurations containing between *nmin* and *nmax* "
"electrons in the specified orbitals *orb*\\ :math:`_1`, *orb*\\ :math:`_2`, "
":math:`\\ldots`, *orb*\\ :math:`_n` are included in the reference function. "
"If *nmin* and *nmax* are negative, configurations with exactly abs(*nmin*) "
"and abs(*nmax*) electrons in the specified orbitals are deleted. This can be"
" used, for instance, to omit singly excited configurations. The orbitals are"
" specified in the form *number.sym*, where *number* is the number of the "
"orbital in irrep *sym*. Several ``RESTRICT`` cards may follow each other."
msgstr ""
"此卡片可用于限制参考组态中的占据模式。只有那些在指定轨道 *orb*\\ :math:`_1`, *orb*\\ :math:`_2`, "
":math:`\\ldots`, *orb*\\ :math:`_n` 中包含 *nmin* 到 *nmax* 个电子的组态才会被包含在参考函数中。如果"
" *nmin* 和 *nmax* 为负数，则删除在指定轨道中恰好有 abs(*nmin*) 和 abs(*nmax*) "
"个电子的组态。例如，这可用于省略单激发组态。轨道以 *number.sym* 的形式指定，其中 *number* 是轨道在不可约表示 *sym* "
"中的编号。多个 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片可以连续出现。"

msgid ""
"The ``RESTRICT`` cards must follow the ``WF`` or ``REF`` cards to which they"
" apply. The general order of these cards is"
msgstr "``RESTRICT`` 卡片必须跟在它们所应用的 ``WF`` 或 ``REF`` 卡片之后。这些卡片的一般顺序是"

msgid ""
"If a ``RESTRICT`` cards precedes the ``WF`` card, it applies to all "
"reference symmetries. Note that ``RESTRICT`` also affects the spaces "
"generated by ``SELECT`` and/or ``CON`` cards."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片出现在 ``WF`` 卡片之前，则它适用于所有参考对称性。请注意，\\ ``RESTRICT`` 也会影响由 "
"``SELECT`` 和/或 ``CON`` 卡片生成的空间。"

msgid "Explicitly specifying reference configurations"
msgstr "显式指定参考组态"

msgid ""
"Specifies an orbital configuration to be included in the reference function."
" :math:`n_1`, :math:`n_2` etc. are the occupation numbers of the active "
"orbitals (0,1,or 2). Any number of ``CON`` cards may follow each other, but "
"they must all appear directly after a ``SELECT`` card."
msgstr ""
"指定一个要包含在参考函数中的轨道组态。\\ :math:`n_1`, :math:`n_2` 等是活性轨道的占据数（0、1 或 2）。任意数量的 "
"``CON`` 卡片可以连续出现，但它们都必须紧跟在 ``SELECT`` 卡片之后。"

msgid "Defining state numbers"
msgstr "定义态编号"

msgid ""
"*nstate* is the number of states treated simultaneously; *nroot(i)* are the "
"root numbers to be calculated. These apply to the order of the states in the"
" initial internal CI. If not specified, *nroot(i)*\\ =\\ :math:`i`. Note "
"that it is possible to leave out states, i.e.,"
msgstr ""
"*nstate* 是同时处理的态的数量；\\ *nroot(i)* 是要计算的根编号。这些编号对应于初始内部 CI 中态的顺序。若未指定，则 "
"*nroot(i)* = :math:`i`\\ 。注意可以省略某些态，即，"

msgid ""
"All states specified must be reasonably described by the internal "
"configuration space. It is possible to have different convergence thresholds"
" for each state (see ``ACCU`` card). It is also possible not to converge "
"some lower roots which are included in the list *nroot(i)* (see ``REFSTATE``"
" card). For examples, see ``REFSTATE`` card."
msgstr ""
"所有指定的态必须能被内部组态空间合理地描述。可以为每个态设置不同的收敛阈值（参见 ``ACCU`` 卡片）。也可以不收敛包含在列表 *nroot(i)*"
" 中的某些较低能级的根（参见 ``REFSTATE`` 卡片）。示例请见 ``REFSTATE`` 卡片。"

msgid "Defining reference state numbers"
msgstr "定义参考态编号"

msgid ""
"*nstatr* is the number of reference states for generating contracted pairs. "
"This may be larger or smaller than *nstate*. If this card is not present, "
"*nstatr*\\ =\\ *nstate* and *nrootr(i)*\\ =\\ *nroot(i)*. Roots for which no"
" reference states are specified but which are specified on the ``STATE`` "
"card (or included by default if the *nroot(i)* are not specified explicitly "
"on the ``STATE`` card) will not be converged, since the result will be bad "
"anyway. However, it is often useful to include these states in the list "
"*nroot(i)*, since it helps to avoid root flipping problems. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"*nstatr* 是用于生成收缩对的参考态的数量。它可以大于或小于 *nstate*\\ 。如果未提供此卡片，则 *nstatr* = *nstate*"
" 且 *nrootr(i)* = *nroot(i)*\\ 。对于那些未指定参考态，但在 ``STATE`` 卡片上指定了（或者如果 "
"*nroot(i)* 未在 ``STATE`` 卡片上显式指定，则默认包含）的根，将不会被收敛，因为其结果无论如何都会很差。然而，将这些态包含在列表 "
"*nroot(i)* 中通常是有用的，因为它有助于避免根翻转问题。示例："

msgid "will calculate two states with two reference states."
msgstr "将计算两个态，使用两个参考态。"

msgid ""
"will optimize second state with one reference state. One external expansion "
"vector will be generated for the ground state in order to avoid root "
"flipping. The results printed for state 1 are bad and should not be used "
"(unless the pair space is complete, which might happen in very small "
"calculations)."
msgstr ""
"将使用一个参考态优化第二个态。将为基态生成一个外部展开向量以避免根翻转。为态 1 "
"打印的结果很差，不应使用（除非对空间是完备的，这在非常小的计算中可能发生）。"

msgid ""
"As the second example, but no external expansion vectors will be generated "
"for the ground state. This should give exactly the same energy for state 2 "
"as before if there is no root flipping (which, however, frequently occurs)."
msgstr "与第二个示例相同，但不会为基态生成外部展开向量。如果没有根翻转（然而，这种情况经常发生），这应该会为态2提供与之前完全相同的能量。"

msgid ""
"Will calculate second state with two reference states. The ground state will"
" not be converged (only one iteration is done for state 1) This should give "
"exactly the same energy for state 2 as the first example."
msgstr "将使用两个参考态计算第二个态。基态将不会收敛（仅对态1进行一次迭代）。这应该会为态2提供与第一个示例完全相同的能量。"

msgid "Specifying correlation of orbital pairs"
msgstr "指定轨道对的相关性"

msgid "is a request to correlate a given orbital pair."
msgstr "是请求对给定轨道对进行相关。"

msgid ""
"Default is to correlate all electron pairs in active and closed orbitals. "
"See also ``PAIRS`` card."
msgstr "默认关联活性和闭壳轨道中的所有电子对。另请参见 ``PAIRS`` 卡片。"

msgid ""
"Correlate all pairs which can be formed from orbitals *iorb1.isy1* through "
"*iorb2.isy2*. Core orbitals are excluded. Either *iorb2* must be larger than"
" *iorb1* or *isy2* larger than *isy1*. If *iorb1.isy1*\\ =\\ *iorb2.isy2* "
"the ``PAIRS`` card has the same effect as a ``PAIR`` card. ``PAIR`` and "
"``PAIRS`` cards may be combined."
msgstr ""
"关联所有可由轨道 *iorb1.isy1* 到 *iorb2.isy2* 形成的电子对。芯轨道被排除在外。\\ *iorb2* 必须大于 "
"*iorb1*\\ ，或者 *isy2* 大于 *isy1*\\ 。如果 *iorb1.isy1*\\ =\\ *iorb2.isy2*\\ ，则 "
"``PAIRS`` 卡片与 ``PAIR`` 卡片具有相同效果。\\ ``PAIR`` 和 ``PAIRS`` 卡片可以组合使用。"

msgid ""
"If no ``PAIR`` and no ``PAIRS`` card is specified, all valence orbitals are "
"correlated. The created pair list restricts not only the doubly external "
"configurations, but also the all internal and semi internals."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定 ``PAIR`` 和 ``PAIRS`` 卡片，则关联所有价层轨道。生成的电子对列表不仅限制双外禀组态，也限制所有内禀和半内禀组态。"

msgid "Restriction of classes of excitations"
msgstr "激发类别的限制"

msgid "``NOPAIR;``"
msgstr "``NOPAIR;``"

msgid "No doubly external configurations are included."
msgstr "不包含双外禀组态。"

msgid "``NOSINGLE;``"
msgstr "``NOSINGLE;``"

msgid "No singly external configurations are included."
msgstr "不包含单外部组态。"

msgid "``NOEXC;``"
msgstr "``NOEXC;``"

msgid "Perform CI with the reference configurations only."
msgstr "仅使用参考组态进行CI计算。"

msgid "Coupled Electron Pair Approximation"
msgstr "耦合电子对近似"

msgid ""
"(:math:`0 \\le ncepa \\le 3`). Instead of diagonalizing the hamiltonian, "
"perform CEPA calculation, CEPA type *ncepa*. This is currently available "
"only for single configuration reference functions."
msgstr ""
"(:math:`0 \\le ncepa \\le 3`)。不进行哈密顿量对角化，而是执行CEPA计算，CEPA类型为 *ncepa*\\ "
"。目前仅适用于单组态参考函数。"

msgid "Coupled Pair Functional (ACPF, AQCC)"
msgstr "耦合对泛函 (ACPF, AQCC)"

msgid "where options can be"
msgstr "其中选项可以是"

msgid ""
"The ACPF and related methods are currently not robustly working for excited "
"states. Even though it sometimes works, we do not currently recommend and "
"support these methods for excited state calculations."
msgstr "ACPF及相关方法目前在激发态计算中尚未稳定工作。尽管有时有效，但我们目前不推荐也不支持将这些方法用于激发态计算。"

msgid "Projected excited state calculations"
msgstr "投影激发态计算"

msgid ""
"Initiate or continue a projected excited state calculation, with information"
" stored on *record*. If *nprojc*\\ :math:`>0`, the internal CI vectors of "
"*nprojc* previous calculations are used to make a projection operator. If "
"*nprojc*\\ :math:`=-1`, this calculation is forced to be the first, i.e. "
"ground state, with no projection. If *nprojc*\\ :math:`=0`, then if *record*"
" does not exist, the effect is the same as *nprojc*\\ :math:`=-1`; otherwise"
" *nprojc* is recovered from the dump in *record*. Thus for the start up "
"calculation, it is best to use ``project``,\\ *record*,-1; for the following"
" excited calculations, use ``project``,\\ *record*; At the end of the "
"calculation, the wavefunction is saved, and the information in the dump "
"*record* updated. The project card also sets the ``tranh`` option, so by "
"default, transition hamiltonian matrices are calculated."
msgstr ""
"启动或继续一个投影激发态计算，相关信息存储在 *record* 中。如果 *nprojc* :math:`>0`\\ ，则使用 *nprojc* "
"个先前计算的内部 CI 向量来构建投影算符。如果 *nprojc* :math:`=-1`\\ ，则强制此计算为第一个（即基态）计算，不进行投影。如果 "
"*nprojc* :math:`=0`\\ ，那么若 *record* 不存在，效果等同于 *nprojc* :math:`=-1`\\ ；否则从 "
"*record* 中的转储信息恢复 *nprojc*\\ 。因此，对于启动计算，最好使用 ``project``,\\ "
"*record*,-1；对于后续的激发态计算，使用 ``project``,\\ *record*\\ ；计算结束时，波函数会被保存，并且转储 "
"*record* 中的信息会被更新。project 卡片还会设置 ``tranh`` 选项，因此默认会计算跃迁哈密顿矩阵。"

msgid "For example, to do successive calculations for three states, use"
msgstr "例如，要对三个态进行连续计算，请使用"

msgid ""
"At the end of each calculation, Hamiltonian is diagonalized over the whole "
"set of projected functions, and the diagonal and transition properties are "
"transformed accordingly. The untransformed properties, if required, can be "
"retrieved from the output."
msgstr "在每个计算结束时，哈密顿量会在整个投影函数集上对角化，对角性质和跃迁性质也相应地进行变换。如果需要，未变换的性质可以从输出中获取。"

msgid "Transition matrix element options"
msgstr "跃迁矩阵元选项"

msgid ""
"If *option*\\ :math:`>-1`, this forces calculation of transition hamiltonian"
" matrix elements in a ``TRANS`` or ``PROJECT`` calculation. If *option*\\ "
":math:`<1`, this forces calculation of one electron transition properties."
msgstr ""
"如果 *option* :math:`>-1`\\ ，这会在 ``TRANS`` 或 ``PROJECT`` 计算中强制计算跃迁哈密顿矩阵元。如果 "
"*option* :math:`<1`\\ ，这会强制计算单电子跃迁性质。"

msgid "Convergence thresholds"
msgstr "收敛阈值"

msgid "Denominator shifts for pairs, singles, and internals, respectively."
msgstr "分别用于对、单激发和内部 CI 的分母位移。"

msgid "Maximum number of iterations"
msgstr "最大迭代次数"

msgid "Restricting numbers of expansion vectors"
msgstr "限制展开向量的数量"

msgid "Selecting the primary configuration set"
msgstr "选择主组态集"

msgid "Canonicalizing external orbitals"
msgstr "外部轨道正则化"

msgid ""
"External orbitals are obtained as eigenfunctions of a Fock operator with the"
" specified occupation numbers :math:`n_i`. Occupation numbers must be "
"provided for all valence orbitals."
msgstr "外部轨道作为具有指定占据数 :math:`n_i` 的 Fock 算符的本征函数获得。必须为所有价层轨道提供占据数。"

msgid "Saving the wavefunction"
msgstr "保存波函数"

msgid ""
"``SPINDEN`` In the second form, if specified, spin-density is evaluated and "
"stored. It is not done by default, due to additional required memory and CPU"
" time."
msgstr "``SPINDEN`` 在第二种形式中，如果指定，则计算并存储自旋密度。由于需要额外的内存和 CPU 时间，默认情况下不执行此操作。"

msgid "Starting wavefunction"
msgstr "起始波函数"

msgid "One electron properties"
msgstr "单电子性质"

msgid "Transition moment calculations"
msgstr "跃迁矩计算"

msgid ""
"Instead of performing an energy calculation, only calculate transition "
"matrix elements between wavefunctions saved on records *readc1* and "
"*readc2*. See section `One-electron operators and expectation values "
"(GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-"
"values-gexpec>`__ for a list of available operators and their corresponding "
"keywords. If no operator names are specified, the dipole transition moments "
"are calculated."
msgstr ""
"不执行能量计算，仅计算保存在记录 *readc1* 和 *readc2* 上的波函数之间的跃迁矩阵元。可用算符列表及其对应关键词请参见章节 "
"`单电子算符与期望值 (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-"
"expectation-values-gexpec>`__\\ 。如果未指定算符名称，则计算偶极跃迁矩。"

msgid ""
"If option ``BIORTH`` is given, the two wavefunctions may use different "
"orbitals. However, the number of active and inactive orbitals must be the "
"same in each case. Note that ``BIORTH`` is not working for spin-orbit matrix"
" elements. Under certain conditions it may happen that biorthogonalization "
"is not possible, and then an error message will be printed. For transition "
"properties which have nonzero nuclear contribution, the corresponding "
"geometry is then that of the ket state (*readc2*). The same is valid when "
"origin of operator is explicitly specified as a center number, i.e. its "
"coordinates will be those for the ket state."
msgstr ""
"如果给出选项 ``BIORTH``\\ ，则两个波函数可以使用不同的轨道。但是，每种情况下的活性轨道和非活性轨道数量必须相同。请注意，\\ "
"``BIORTH`` 不适用于自旋-"
"轨道矩阵元。在某些条件下，双正交化可能无法实现，届时将打印错误信息。对于具有非零核贡献的跃迁性质，相应的几何结构将是右矢态 (*readc2*) "
"的几何结构。当算符原点被明确指定为中心编号时，同样适用，即其坐标将是右矢态的坐标。"

msgid "Saving the density matrix"
msgstr "保存密度矩阵"

msgid ""
"The first order density matrices for all computed states are stored in "
"record *record* on file *ifil*. If *idip* is not zero, the dipole moments "
"are printed starting at iteration *idip*. See also ``NATORB``. In case of "
"transition moment calculation, the transition densities are also stored, "
"provided both states involved have the same symmetry."
msgstr ""
"所有计算态的一阶密度矩阵存储在文件 *ifil* 的记录 *record* 中。如果 *idip* 不为零，则从迭代 *idip* "
"开始打印偶极矩。另请参见 ``NATORB``\\ 。在进行跃迁矩计算时，如果所涉及的两个态具有相同的对称性，跃迁密度也会被存储。"

msgid "Natural orbitals"
msgstr "自然轨道"

msgid ""
"Calculate natural orbitals. The number of printed external orbitals in any "
"given symmetry is *nprint*) (default 2). *nprint=-1* suppressed the "
"printing. If *record* is nonzero, the natural orbitals and density matrices "
"for all states are saved in a dump record *record* on file *ifil*. If "
"*record.ifil* is specified on a ``DM`` card (see above), this record is "
"used. If different records are specified on the ``DM`` and ``NATORB`` cards,"
" an error will result. The record can also be given on the ``SAVE`` card. If"
" ``CORE`` is specified, core orbitals are not printed."
msgstr ""
"计算自然轨道。在任何给定对称性中打印的外部轨道数量为 *nprint*\\ （默认值为 2）。\\ *nprint=-1* 将抑制打印。如果 "
"*record* 不为零，则所有态的自然轨道和密度矩阵将保存在文件 *ifil* 的转储记录 *record* 中。如果在 ``DM`` 卡片上指定了 "
"*record.ifil*\\ （见上文），则使用该记录。如果在 ``DM`` 和 ``NATORB`` "
"卡片上指定了不同的记录，将导致错误。该记录也可以在 ``SAVE`` 卡片上指定。如果指定了 ``CORE``\\ ，则不打印芯轨道。"

msgid ""
"Note: The dump record must not be the same as *savecp* or *saveco* on the "
"``SAVE`` card, or the record given on the ``PROJECT``."
msgstr ""
"注意：转储记录不得与 ``SAVE`` 卡片上的 *savecp* 或 *saveco* 相同，也不得与 ``PROJECT`` 上给定的记录相同。"

msgid "Miscellaneous options"
msgstr "杂项选项"

msgid ""
"Can be used to specify program parameters and options. If no codes and "
"values are specified, active values are displayed. The equal signs may be "
"omitted. The following codes are allowed (max 7 per card):"
msgstr "可用于指定程序参数和选项。如果未指定代码和值，则显示当前活动值。等号可以省略。允许使用以下代码（每张卡片最多 7 个）："

msgid "``NSTATE:`` see ``state`` card"
msgstr "``NSTATE:`` 参见 ``state`` 卡片"

msgid "``NSTATI:`` number of states calculated in internal CI"
msgstr "``NSTATI:`` 内部 CI 中计算的状态数"

msgid "``NSTATR:`` see ``refstat`` card"
msgstr "``NSTATR:`` 参见 ``refstat`` 卡片"

msgid "``NCEPA:`` see ``CEPA`` card"
msgstr "``NCEPA:`` 参见 ``CEPA`` 卡片"

msgid "``NOKOP:`` if nonzero, skip integral transformation"
msgstr "``NOKOP:`` 若非零，则跳过积分变换"

msgid "``ITRDM:`` if .ge. 0 transition moments are calculated"
msgstr "``ITRDM:`` 若 .ge. 0，则计算跃迁矩"

msgid ""
"``ITRANS:`` if nonzero, perform full integral transformation (not yet "
"implemented)"
msgstr "``ITRANS:`` 若非零，则执行完整的积分变换（尚未实现）"

msgid "``IDIP:`` Print dipole moments from iteration number *value*"
msgstr "``IDIP:`` 从迭代次数 *value* 开始打印偶极矩"

msgid ""
"``REFOPT:`` if nonzero, optimize reference coefficients; otherwise extract "
"reference coefficients from internal CI"
msgstr "``REFOPT:`` 若非零，则优化参考系数；否则从内部 CI 提取参考系数"

msgid ""
"``IAVDEN:`` average HII and HSS denominators over spin couplings if nonzero"
msgstr "``IAVDEN:`` 若非零，则对自旋耦合平均 HII 和 HSS 分母"

msgid "``IDELCG:`` if.ne.0 then destroy files icfil,igfil at end"
msgstr "``IDELCG:`` 若 .ne.0 则在结束时销毁文件 icfil, igfil"

msgid "``IREST:`` if nonzero, restart"
msgstr "``IREST:`` 若非零，则重新启动"

msgid ""
"``NATORB:`` if nonzero, natural orbitals are calculated and printed. The "
"number of printed external orbitals per symmetry is min(*natorb*,2)"
msgstr "``NATORB:`` 若非零，则计算并打印自然轨道。每个对称性打印的外部轨道数为 min(*natorb*,2)"

msgid "``WFNAT:`` if nonzero, natural orbitals are saved to this record"
msgstr "``WFNAT:`` 若非零，则将自然轨道保存到此记录"

msgid "``IPUNRF:`` if nonzero, punch coefficients of reference configurations"
msgstr "``IPUNRF:`` 若非零，则穿孔参考组态的系数"

msgid ""
"``NPUPD:`` if nonzero, update pairs in nonorthogonal basis, otherwise in "
"orthogonal basis."
msgstr "``NPUPD:`` 若非零，则在非正交基中更新对，否则在正交基中更新。"

msgid "``MAXIT:`` see ``maxiter`` card"
msgstr "``MAXIT:`` 参见 ``maxiter`` 卡片"

msgid "``MAXITI:`` see ``maxiter`` card"
msgstr "``MAXITI:`` 参见 ``maxiter`` 卡片"

msgid "``MAXDAV:`` see ``maxdav`` card"
msgstr "``MAXDAV:`` 参见 ``maxdav`` 卡片"

msgid "``MAXVI:`` see ``maxdav`` card"
msgstr "``MAXVI:`` 参见 ``maxdav`` 卡片"

msgid "``NOSING:`` see ``nosing`` card"
msgstr "``NOSING:`` 参见 ``nosing`` 卡片"

msgid "``NOPAIR:`` see ``nopair`` card"
msgstr "``NOPAIR:`` 参见 ``nopair`` 卡片"

msgid "``MXSHRF:`` see ``select`` card"
msgstr "``MXSHRF:`` 参见 ``select`` 卡片"

msgid ""
"``IKCPS=0:`` In CIKEXT, only K(CP) is calculated; this option taken when and"
" only when no singles."
msgstr "``IKCPS=0:`` 在 CIKEXT 中，仅计算 K(CP)；此选项仅在无单激发时采用。"

msgid ""
"``IKCPS=1:`` only K(CP’) is calculated. Implies that modified coupling "
"coefficients are used."
msgstr "``IKCPS=1:`` 仅计算 K(CP')。这意味着使用修改后的耦合系数。"

msgid ""
"``IKCPS=2:`` K(CP) and K(CP’) are calculated. Default is IKCPS=2 except when"
" single reference configuration, when IKCPS=1."
msgstr "``IKCPS=2:`` 计算 K(CP) 和 K(CP')。默认值为 IKCPS=2，除非是单参考组态，此时 IKCPS=1。"

msgid "``IOPTGM:`` Option for density matrix routines."
msgstr "``IOPTGM:`` 密度矩阵例程的选项。"

msgid ""
"``IOPTGM=0:`` all quantities in density matrix routines are recalculated for"
" each intermediate symmetry (max. CPU, min. core)."
msgstr "``IOPTGM=0:`` 密度矩阵例程中的所有量针对每个中间对称性重新计算（CPU 使用最大，内存使用最小）。"

msgid ""
"``IOPTGM=1:`` quantities precalculated and stored on disk (max. I/O, min. "
"core)."
msgstr "``IOPTGM=1:`` 量被预先计算并存储在磁盘上（I/O 最大，内存使用最小）。"

msgid ""
"``IOPTGM=2:`` quantities precalculated and kept in core (min. CPU, max. "
"core)."
msgstr "``IOPTGM=2:`` 量被预先计算并保存在内存中（CPU 使用最小，内存使用最大）。"

msgid ""
"``IOPTOR:`` If nonzero, calculate intermediate orbitals for each pair. Might"
" improve convergence in some cases, in particular if localized orbitals are "
"used."
msgstr "``IOPTOR:`` 如果非零，为每对计算中间轨道。在某些情况下可能改善收敛性，特别是当使用定域轨道时。"

msgid "Miscellaneous parameters"
msgstr "杂项参数"

msgid ""
"Redefine system parameters. If no codes are specified, the default values "
"are displayed. The following codes are allowed:"
msgstr "重新定义系统参数。如果未指定代码，则显示默认值。允许使用以下代码："

msgid "``LSEG:`` disc sector length"
msgstr "``LSEG:`` 磁盘扇区长度"

msgid "``IVECT=0:`` scalar machine"
msgstr "``IVECT=0:`` 标量机器"

msgid "``IVECT=1:`` vector machine"
msgstr "``IVECT=1:`` 向量机器"

msgid ""
"``MINVEC:`` call MXMB in coupling coefficient routines if vector length "
"larger than this value."
msgstr "``MINVEC:`` 如果向量长度大于此值，则在耦合系数例程中调用 MXMB。"

msgid ""
"``LTR:`` determines how matrices are stored on disc. If LTR=LSEG, all "
"matrices start at sector boundaries (which optimizes I/O), but unused space "
"is between matrices (both on disc and in core). With LTR=1 all matrices are "
"stored dense. This might increase I/O if much paging is necessary, but "
"reduce I/O if everything fits in core."
msgstr ""
"``LTR:`` 决定矩阵如何存储在磁盘上。如果 LTR=LSEG，所有矩阵从扇区边界开始（这优化了 "
"I/O），但矩阵之间存在未使用的空间（在磁盘和内存中都是）。如果 LTR=1，所有矩阵都密集存储。如果需要进行大量分页，这可能会增加 "
"I/O，但如果所有内容都适合内存，则会减少 I/O。"

msgid "``NCPUS:`` Maximum number of CPUs to be used in multitasking."
msgstr "``NCPUS:`` 多任务处理中使用的最大 CPU 数量。"

msgid "Miscellaneous thresholds"
msgstr "杂项阈值"

msgid "``ZERO:`` numerical zero"
msgstr "``ZERO:`` 数值零"

msgid ""
"``THRDLP:`` delete pairs if eigenvalue of overlap matrix is smaller than "
"this threshold."
msgstr "``THRDLP:`` 如果重叠矩阵的特征值小于此阈值，则删除对。"

msgid ""
"``PNORM:`` delete pair if its norm is smaller than this threshold (all pairs"
" are normalized to one for a closed shell case)."
msgstr "``PNORM:`` 若对范数小于此阈值则删除该对（对于闭壳层情况，所有对均归一化为一）。"

msgid "``PRINTCI:`` print CI coefficients which are larger than this value."
msgstr "``PRINTCI:`` 打印大于此值的 CI 系数。"

msgid ""
"``INTEG:`` omit two-electron integrals which are smaller than this value."
msgstr "``INTEG:`` 忽略小于此值的双电子积分。"

msgid "``ENERGY:`` convergence threshold for energy; see also: ``ACCU`` card."
msgstr "``ENERGY:`` 能量的收敛阈值；另见：\\ ``ACCU`` 卡片。"

msgid ""
"``COEFF:`` convergence threshold for coefficients; see also: ``ACCU`` card."
msgstr "``COEFF:`` 系数的收敛阈值；另见：\\ ``ACCU`` 卡片。"

msgid ""
"``SPARSE:`` omit coefficient changes which are smaller than this value."
msgstr "``SPARSE:`` 忽略小于此值的系数变化。"

msgid ""
"``EQUAL:`` set values in the internal vector and the diagonal elements equal"
" if they differ by less than this value. Useful for keeping track of "
"symmetry."
msgstr "``EQUAL:`` 若内部向量中的值与对角元之差小于此值，则将它们设为相等。有助于跟踪对称性。"

msgid "Print options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid ""
"Print options. Generally, the value determines how much intermediate "
"information is printed. *value*\\ =-1 means no print (default for all "
"codes). In some of the cases listed below the specification of higher values"
" will generate even more output than described. The equal signs and zeros "
"may be omitted. All codes may be truncated to three characters. The "
"following codes are allowed (max 7 per card):"
msgstr ""
"打印选项。通常，该值决定了打印多少中间信息。\\ *value*\\ =-1 "
"表示不打印（所有代码的默认值）。在下面列出的一些情况下，指定更高的值将产生比描述的更多的输出。等号和零可以省略。所有代码可以截断为三个字符。允许以下代码（每张卡片最多"
" 7 个）："

msgid "``ORBITALS:`` print orbitals"
msgstr "``ORBITALS:`` 打印轨道"

msgid "``JOP=0:`` print operator list"
msgstr "``JOP=0:`` 打印算符列表"

msgid "``JOP=1:`` print coulomb operators in MO basis"
msgstr "``JOP=1:`` 打印 MO 基中的 Coulomb 算符"

msgid "``JOP=2:`` print coulomb operators in AO and MO basis"
msgstr "``JOP=2:`` 打印 AO 和 MO 基中的 Coulomb 算符"

msgid "``KOP:`` as ``JOP`` for internal exchange operators"
msgstr "``KOP:`` 与 ``JOP`` 类似，但用于内部交换算符"

msgid "``KCP=0:`` print paging information for CIKEXT"
msgstr "``KCP=0:`` 打印 CIKEXT 的分页信息"

msgid "``KCP=1:`` print external exchange operators in MO basis"
msgstr "``KCP=1:`` 在 MO 基中打印外部交换算符"

msgid "``KCP=2:`` print operators in AO and MO basis"
msgstr "``KCP=2:`` 在 AO 和 MO 基中打印算符"

msgid "``DM=0:`` print paging information for CIDIMA"
msgstr "``DM=0:`` 打印 CIDIMA 的分页信息"

msgid "``DM=1:`` print density matrix in MO basis"
msgstr "``DM=1:`` 在 MO 基中打印密度矩阵"

msgid "``DM=2:`` print density matrix in AO and MO basis"
msgstr "``DM=2:`` 在 AO 和 MO 基中打印密度矩阵"

msgid "``FPP=0:`` print energy denominators for pairs"
msgstr "``FPP=0:`` 打印对（pairs）的能量分母"

msgid ""
"``FPP=1:`` in addition, print diagonal coupling coefficients in orthogonal "
"basis."
msgstr "``FPP=1:`` 此外，在正交基中打印对角耦合系数。"

msgid "``FPP=2:`` print operators FPP"
msgstr "``FPP=2:`` 打印算符 FPP"

msgid "``CP=0:`` print update information for pairs in each iteration"
msgstr "``CP=0:`` 在每次迭代中打印对组的更新信息"

msgid "``CP=1:`` print pair matrix updates (MO basis)"
msgstr "``CP=1:`` 打印对矩阵更新（MO 基）"

msgid "``CP=2:`` in addition print pair matrices (MO basis)"
msgstr "``CP=2:`` 额外打印对矩阵（MO 基）"

msgid "``CP=3:`` print CP in AO basis (in CIKEXT)"
msgstr "``CP=3:`` 在原子轨道基组中打印 CP（在 CIKEXT 中）"

msgid "``CI=0:`` print convergence information for internal CI"
msgstr "``CI=0:`` 打印内部 CI 的收敛信息"

msgid ""
"``CI=1:`` print internal CI coefficients and external expansion coefficients"
msgstr "``CI=1:`` 打印内部 CI 系数和外部展开系数"

msgid "``CS:`` as CP for singles"
msgstr "``CS:`` 与 CP 类似，但针对单激发"

msgid "``CPS=0:`` print paging information for CICPS"
msgstr "``CPS=0:`` 打印 CICPS 的分页信息"

msgid "``CPS=1:`` print matrices CPS in MO basis"
msgstr "``CPS=1:`` 在 MO 基中打印 CPS 矩阵"

msgid "``GPP=0:`` print paging information for CIGPQ"
msgstr "``GPP=0:`` 打印 CIGPQ 的分页信息"

msgid "``GPP=1:`` print matrices GP at exit of CIGPQ"
msgstr "``GPP=1:`` 在 CIGPQ 退出时打印 GP 矩阵"

msgid "``GPS=0:`` print paging information for CIGPS"
msgstr "``GPS=0:`` 打印 CIGPS 的分页信息"

msgid "``GPS=1:`` print vectors GS at exit CIGPS"
msgstr "``GPS=1:`` 在 CIGPS 退出时打印 GS 向量"

msgid "``GSP=1:`` print matrices GP at exit CIGPS"
msgstr "``GSP=1:`` 在 CIGPS 退出时打印 GP 矩阵"

msgid "``GPI=0:`` print paging information for CIGPI"
msgstr "``GPI=0:`` 打印 CIGPI 的分页信息"

msgid "``GPI=1:`` print total GP in orthogonal basis"
