msgid ""
"The command ``CI`` or ``CI-PRO`` or ``MRCI`` calls the MRCI program. The "
"command ``MRCI-F12`` calls the explicitly correlated MRCI-F12 program. The "
"command ``CISD`` calls fast closed-shell CISD program. The command ``QCI`` "
"calls closed-shell quadratic CI program. The command ``CCSD`` calls closed-"
"shell coupled-cluster program."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``CI`` 或 ``CI-PRO`` 或 ``MRCI`` 调用 MRCI 程序。命令 ``MRCI-F12`` 调用显式相关的 "
"MRCI-F12 程序。命令 ``CISD`` 调用快速闭壳层 CISD 程序。命令 ``QCI`` 调用闭壳层二次 CI 程序。命令 ``CCSD``"
" 调用闭壳层耦合簇程序。"

msgid "**``MAXIT=``\\ *value*** Maximum number of iterations."
msgstr "**``MAXIT=``\\ *\\ value*** 最大迭代次数。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXITI=``\\ *value*** Maximum number of microiterations (for internals)."
msgstr "**``MAXITI=``\\ *\\ value*** 最大微迭代次数（针对内部组态）。"

msgid ""
"**``SHIFTI=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of internal "
"configurations."
msgstr "**``SHIFTI=``\\ *\\ value*** 更新内部组态的分母位移。"

msgid "**``SHIFTS=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of singles."
msgstr "**``SHIFTS=``\\ *\\ value*** 更新单激发项的分母位移。"

msgid "**``SHIFTP=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of doubles."
msgstr "**``SHIFTP=``\\ *\\ value*** 更新双激发项的分母位移。"

msgid "**``THRDEN=``\\ *value*** Convergence threshold for the energy."
msgstr "**``THRDEN=``\\ *\\ value*** 能量的收敛阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRVAR=``\\ *value*** Convergence threshold for the CI-vector. This "
"applies to the square sum of the changes of the CI-coefficients."
msgstr "**``THRVAR=``\\ *\\ value*** CI 向量的收敛阈值。该阈值应用于 CI 系数变化量的平方和。"

msgid ""
"**``ROTREF=``\\ *value*** If *value*\\ =0 the cluster corrections are not "
"printed for the rotated reference energies (cf. Section `cluster corrections"
" for multi-state MRCI <the_mrci_program.html#cluster-corrections-for-multi-"
"state-mrci>`__). If *value*\\ =1 all corrections are printed. If *value*\\ "
"=2 (default) the reference are transformed to maximize the overlap with the "
"final MRCI wavefunctions, and the cluster corrections are computed using "
"these rotated reference states. If *value*\\ =-1 the 2009.1 behaviour is "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"**``ROTREF=``\\ *\\ value*** 若 *\\ value\\ *\\ =0，则不对旋转后的参考态能量打印簇修正（参见 "
"`cluster corrections for multi-state MRCI <the_mrci_program.html#cluster-"
"corrections-for-multi-state-mrci>`__ 一节）。若 *\\ value\\ *\\ =1，则打印所有修正。若 *\\ "
"value\\ *\\ =2（默认值），则将参考态进行变换以最大化与最终 MRCI 波函数的重叠，并使用这些旋转后的参考态计算簇修正。若 *\\ "
"value*\\ =-1，则恢复 2009.1 版的行为。"

msgid ""
"**``CIREC=``\\ *record*** If given, the program attempts reading the "
"reference vectors from a previous CASSCF calculation. The vectors must have "
"been saved in the CASSCF using ``SAVE,CIREC=``\\ *record* This will only "
"work if the active spaces in the CASSCF and MRCI are the same."
msgstr ""
"**``CIREC=``\\ *\\ record*** 若指定，程序将尝试从先前的 CASSCF 计算中读取参考向量。这些向量必须已在 CASSCF "
"中使用 ``SAVE,CIREC=``\\ *\\ record* 保存。仅当 CASSCF 与 MRCI 中的活性空间相同时此功能才有效。"

