"read from the specified record. If *rec2* is negative, all records between "
"*rec1* and abs(*rec2*) are read. All configurations found in this way are "
"merged."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***refthr*:** Selection threshold for configurations read from disc (records"
" *rec1–rec2*). This applies to the norm of all CSFs for each orbital "
"configuration."
msgstr "***refthr*\\ ：** 从磁盘（记录 *\\ rec1–rec2*）读取组态的选择阈值。该阈值应用于每个轨道组态的所有 CSF 的范数。"

msgid ""
"***refstat*:** Specifies from which state vector the configurations are "
"selected. This only applies to the case that the configurations were saved "
"in a state-averaged calculation. If *refstat* is zero or not specified, the "
"configurations are selected from all states. If *refstat* is greater than "
"zero, then the specified reference state is used. If *refstat* is less than "
"zero, then all appropriate reference states are used. Lastly, if *refstat* "
"is of the form *istat1.istat2*, states *istat1* through *istat2* are used."
msgstr ""
"***refstat*\\ ：** 指定从哪个态向量中选择组态。这仅适用于组态在态平均计算中被保存的情况。若 *\\ refstat\\ * "
"为零或未指定，则从所有态中选择组态。若 *\\ refstat\\ * 大于零，则使用指定的参考态。若 *\\ refstat\\ * "
"小于零，则使用所有适当的参考态。最后，若 *\\ refstat\\ * 的形式为 *\\ istat1.istat2\\ *，则使用从 *\\ "
"istat1\\ * 到 *\\ istat2* 的态。"

msgid ""
"***mxshrf*:** maximum number of open shells in the selected or generated "
"configurations."
msgstr "***mxshrf*\\ ：** 所选或所生成组态中开壳层的最大数目。"

msgid "``RESTRICT,nmin,nmax,orb$_1$,orb$_2$,$\\ldots$orb$_n$;``"
msgstr "``RESTRICT,nmin,nmax,orb$_1$,orb$_2$,$\\ldots$orb$_n$;``"

