msgstr "``CEPA(ncepa);``"

msgid "``ACPF,options\\\\`` ``AQCC,options``"
msgstr "``ACPF,options\\\\`` ``AQCC,options``"

msgid "**``GACPFI=``\\ *gacpfi***"
msgstr "**``GACPFI=``\\ *\\ gacpfi***"

msgid "**``GACPFE=``\\ *gacpfe***"
msgstr "**``GACPFE=``\\ *\\ gacpfe***"

msgid ""
"Instead of diagonalizing the hamiltonian, perform ACPF calculation or AQCC "
"calculation. Using the options ``GACPFI`` and ``GAPCPE`` The internal and "
"external normalization factors *gacpfi*, *gacpfe* may be reset from their "
"default values of 1, 2/*nelec* and 1, 1-(*nelec*-2)(*nelec*-3)/*nelec*\\ "
"(*nelec*-1), respectively."
msgstr ""
"不进行哈密顿矩阵对角化，而是执行 ACPF 计算或 AQCC 计算。使用选项 ``GACPFI`` 和 ``GAPCPE``\\ "
"，可将内部和外部归一化因子 *gacpfi*\\ 、\\ *gacpfe* 从默认值 1、2/*nelec* 和 "
"1、1-(*nelec*-2)(*nelec*-3)/*nelec*\\ (*nelec*-1) 分别重新设置。"

msgid "``PROJECT,record,nprojc;``"
msgstr "``PROJECT,record,nprojc;``"

msgid "``TRANH,option;``"
msgstr "``TRANH,option;``"

msgid "``ACCU,istate,energy,coeff;``"
msgstr "``ACCU,istate,energy,coeff;``"

msgid ""
"Convergence thresholds for state *istate*. The actual thresholds for the "
"energy and the CI coefficients are 10\\ **(-*energy*) and 10**-(*coeff*). If"
" this card is not present, the thresholds for all states are the default "
"values or those specified on the ``THRESH`` card."
msgstr ""
"态 *istate* 的收敛阈值。能量和 CI 系数的实际阈值分别为 10\\ **(-*\\ energy\\ *) 和 10**-(*\\ "
"coeff*)。如果未提供此卡片，则所有态的阈值为默认值或 ``THRESH`` 卡片上指定的值。"

msgid "Denominator shifts"
msgstr "分母位移"

msgid "``SHIFT,shiftp,shifts,shifti;``"
msgstr "``SHIFT,shiftp,shifts,shifti;``"

msgid ""
"**Note: these are not level shifts in CASPT2**, but simple denominator "
"shifts which affect the convergence of the iterative Davidson procedure."
msgstr "**注意：这些不是 CASPT2 中的能级位移**\\ ，而是简单的分母位移，影响迭代 Davidson 过程的收敛。"

msgid "``MAXITER,maxit,maxiti;``"
msgstr "``MAXITER,maxit,maxiti;``"

msgid "***maxit*:** maximum number of macroiterations;"
msgstr "***maxit*\\ ：** 最大宏迭代次数；"

msgid "***maxiti*:** maximum number of microiterations (internal CI)."
msgstr "***maxiti*\\ ：** 最大微迭代次数（内部 CI）。"

msgid "``MAXDAV,maxdav,maxvi;``"
msgstr "``MAXDAV,maxdav,maxvi;``"

msgid ""
"***maxdav*:** maximum number of external expansion vectors in "
"macroiterations;"
msgstr "***maxdav*\\ ：** 宏迭代中外部展开向量的最大数目；"

msgid ""
"***maxvi*:** maximum number of internal expansion vectors in internal CI."
msgstr "***maxvi*\\ ：** 内部 CI 中内部展开向量的最大数目。"

msgid "``PSPACE,select,npspac;``"
msgstr "``PSPACE,select,npspac;``"

msgid ""
"***select*:** energy criterion for selecting p-space configurations. If "
"negative, a test for p-space H is performed."
msgstr "***select*\\ ：** 选择 p 空间组态的能量判据。若为负值，则对 p 空间 H 进行检验。"

msgid ""
"***npspac*:** minimum number of p-space configurations. Further "
"configurations are added if either required by select or if configurations "
"are found which are degenerate to the last p-space configuration. A minimum "
"number of npspace is automatically determined from the state specifications."
msgstr ""
"***npspac*\\ ：** p 空间组态的最小数目。如果 select 要求，或发现与最后一个 p 空间组态简并的组态，则添加更多组态。最小 "
"npspace 数目由态规格自动确定。"

msgid "``FOCK,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots$;``"
msgstr "``FOCK,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots$;``"

msgid "``SAVE,savecp,saveco,idelcg;``"
msgstr "``SAVE,savecp,saveco,idelcg;``"

msgid ""
"``SAVE [,CIVEC=savecp] [,CONFIG=saveco] [,DENSITY=dumprec] [,NATORB=dumprec]"
" [,FILES] [,SPINDEN]``"
msgstr ""
"``SAVE [,CIVEC=savecp] [,CONFIG=saveco] [,DENSITY=dumprec] [,NATORB=dumprec]"
" [,FILES] [,SPINDEN]``"

msgid ""
"***savecp*:** record name for save of wavefunction. If negative the "
"wavefunction is saved after each iteration, else at the end of the job. In "
"case of coupled cluster methods (CCSD, QCISD, BCCD), the wavefunction is "
"saved in each iteration in any case."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***saveco*:** record name for save of internal configurations and their "
"maximum weight over all states for subsequent use as reference input (see "
"``SELECT`` card). If the record already exists, the record name is "
"incremented by one until a new record is created."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***idelcg*:** if nonzero or ``FILES`` is specified, don’t erase icfil and "
"igfil (holding CI and residual vectors) at the end of the calculation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***dumprec*:** Dump record for saving density matrix and natural orbitals. "
"Only one dump record must be given. In any case the density matrix and the "
"natural orbitals are saved. See also ``DM`` or ``NATORB`` cards."
msgstr ""

msgid "``START,readc1,irest;``"
msgstr "``START,readc1,irest;``"

msgid ""
"***readc1*:** record name from which the wavefunction is restored for a "
"restart. In the case of coupled cluster methods (CCSD, QCISD, BCCD), the "
"amplitudes are read from record *readc1* and used for restart."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"***irest*:** If nonzero, the CI coefficients are read and used for the "
"restart; otherwise, only the wavefunction definition is read in."
msgstr ""

msgid "``EXPEC,oper$_1$,oper$_2$,oper$_3$,…;``"
msgstr "``EXPEC,oper$_1$,oper$_2$,oper$_3$,…;``"

msgid ""
"After the wavefunction determination, calculate expectation values for one-"
"electron operators *oper:math:`_i`*. See section `One-electron operators and"
" expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-"
"and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ for the available operators and their "
"keywords. In multi-state calculations or in projected calculations, also the"
" transition matrix elements are calculated."
msgstr ""
"在确定波函数之后，计算单电子算符 *oper:math:`_i`* 的期望值。可用算符及其关键字参见 `单电子算符与期望值（GEXPEC） "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__ 一节。在多态计算或投影计算中，还计算跃迁矩阵元。"

msgid "``TRANS,readc1,readc2,[BIORTH],[oper$_1$,oper$_2$,oper$_3$,…];``"
msgstr "``TRANS,readc1,readc2,[BIORTH],[oper$_1$,oper$_2$,oper$_3$,…];``"

