msgid "``MRCI,SWAP,ROTREF=-1.``"
msgstr "``MRCI,SWAP,ROTREF=-1.``"

msgid ""
"The only change needed for including explicitly correlated terms is to "
"append ``-F12`` to the ``MRCI`` command. All other options work as described"
" before. It is recommended to use correlation consistent basis sets (aug-cc-"
"pVnZ or VnZ-F12) since for these the appropriate fitting and RI auxiliary "
"basis sets are chosen automatically. Otherwise it max be necessary to "
"specify these basis sets as described for single-reference methods in "
"section :doc:`explicitly correlated methods "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"引入显式相关项所需的唯一更改是在 ``MRCI`` 命令后追加 ``-F12``\\ 。所有其他选项均按前述方式工作。建议使用相关一致基组（aug-"
"cc-pVnZ 或 VnZ-F12），因为对于这些基组，会自动选择合适的拟合和 RI 辅助基组。否则可能有必要按 :doc:`显式相关方法 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods>` 一节中针对单参考方法所述的方式指定这些基组。"

msgid ""
"**``SCALF12``\\ =\\ *scalf12*** If ``scalf12=1`` (default) the explicitly "
"correlated contributions are treated variationally (``SFIX`` ansatz, see `J."
" Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **134**, 034113 "
"(2011). If ``scalf12=0`` intermediate normalization is used (``FIX`` "
"ansatz)."
msgstr ""
"**``SCALF12``\\ =\\ *\\ scalf12*** 如果 "
"``scalf12=1``（默认），显式相关贡献按变分方式处理（``SFIX`` 拟设，见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **\\ 134**, 034113 (2011)。如果 "
"``scalf12=0``\\ ，则使用中间归一化（\\ ``FIX`` 拟设）。"

msgid ""
"**``CABS_SINGLES``\\ =\\ *isingles*** ``isingles=1``: use singles-CI CABS "
"singles correction (default); ``isingles=2``: use perturbational CABS "
"singles correction; ``isingles=3``: include couplings of CABS singles with "
"MRCI terms."
msgstr ""
"**``CABS_SINGLES``\\ =\\ *\\ isingles*** ``isingles=1``\\ ：使用 singles-CI "
"CABS 单激发修正（默认）；\\ ``isingles=2``\\ ：使用微扰 CABS 单激发修正；\\ ``isingles=3``\\ ：包含 "
"CABS 单激发与 MRCI 项的耦合。"
